", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\7340fb0f991dbfb8e47715c5.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see it. I'll open a dispute for that $42 charge. Would a paper copy of the outcome be helpful?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\fa3aceda933d2b665f31e398.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, electronic is fine.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\727bd9fc97ce68ab4cda3635.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Understood. And was that the only charge you didn't recognize on that statement, or were there others?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\7bf85f6a5368909525c2784a.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, just that single one.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\8aac3edf120b4fe112575459.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. And before we move on, have you shared that number with any recurring payment service?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\11e472b8e5c88c49c7cc04c4.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Only my usual streaming subscription.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\433e1275fd155ff4de8ef399.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I got it. Also, do you use the mobile application to check balances?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\36483e335cb6ec45817dd31b.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, almost every day.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\6f4ea9d8596f3618d778f8f3.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see. And was your physical card in your possession on that day?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\5c331b6db8d9560ea9796d11.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, it was in my wallet the whole time.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\bcd1ba11b66daa7ceefa71a3.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks. One last question. Did you travel outside your normal area recently?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\34746d916dc9709930508eb2.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, I have been home all month.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\005f3d4764ea34d450ec1bec.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. And is the contact number ending in six-one-eight still yours?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\6e2e6c9db82875216e04f5bc.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that number is current.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\e4184e49817e7613bc2052b8.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Okay, no problem. I've noted that on your claim. Would you like me to set up alerts for each of your future transactions?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\a13b5672d520827f51844c5e.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, please turn those on.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\37ff6d2697c35ee6b1d66585.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I've got that request noted in the dispute for you. We're almost finished here, I just need to verify a few more details. Is the mailing address on your profile, 22 Park Dr, San Jose, California, still correct?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\6b0fcf4dab989c1a68be1ad7.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that address is right.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\9abef52f190698a3bc4aaa88.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Absolutely. And did any of the details on the card itself change before this charge occurred? For example, did you receive a new card with a new expiration date or security code?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\f8155306eb265e2ac37bfc1b.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Worth mentioning: my card was reissued a few weeks ago after a skimming alert.", "kind": "clue", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\ce78df2a9109e7b1cb52c328.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I will File the disputed amount into the automated review queue.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\a0221dd9ae4fb12095b58996.wav", "action_label": "D", "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay, I will wait while that goes through.", "kind": "pre_gap_acknowledgement", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\f09dffb68c2d2cbd1aa95c5e.wav"}, {"role": "user", "text": "I checked back after twenty-five minutes and the case came back saying the details did not match anything on record.", "kind": "post_gap_observation", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\3594b5decb3a5c7140b92e36.wav", "prosody": "frustrated"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I will Match the stored account identifiers against the charge before trying again.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard03-of-06\\turns\\76f38648314db84f2d3baac0.wav", "action_label": "C", "response_style_label": null}],